  ('csa-u4-q23', 'ap_csa', '4.15', '4', 'P3', 'mcq', 'Selection sort places the minimum of the unsorted segment at the front each pass. After **two** passes on `{30, 10, 20, 40}`, what is the array?', '{"A":"{10, 20, 40, 30}","B":"{10, 30, 20, 40}","C":"{10, 20, 30, 40}","D":"{20, 10, 30, 40}"}', 'C', NULL, 'Pass 1: min 10 → front: `{10, 30, 20, 40}`. Pass 2: min of `{30,20,40}` is 20, swap with index 1: `{10, 20, 30, 40}`. (Here it is fully sorted after two passes.)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('csa-u4-q24', 'ap_csa', '4.16', '4', 'P3', 'mcq', 'What does `f(3)` return?
